    "work_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.TH.2.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Decuerat quidem beatitudinem vestram divinae considerationis reverentia exortum tam finisse ne­ gotium, ut vobis ordioantibus submoveri potuisset de tanta civitate confusio :",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 509,
    "date_range": [
      493,
      526
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th#PL72.TH.2.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.TH.2.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "maxime cum praetentis affe­ ctibus jusserimus, quemadmodum vestrum visum fuisset arbitrium, memoratam vos terminare debere certamen;",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 509,
    "date_range": [
      493,
      526
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th#PL72.TH.2.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.TH.2.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "dummodo sub justa ordinatione finitum, dissentientes unitati et concordie redderentur.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 509,
    "date_range": [
      493,
      526
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th#PL72.TH.2.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.TH.2.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quam miramur denuo fuisse consultum : cum si nos de præsenti ante voluissemus judicare negotio , habito eum proceribus nostris de inquirenda veritate tra- ciatu,",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 509,
    "date_range": [
      493,
      526
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th#PL72.TH.2.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.TH.2.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Deo auspice, potuissemus inven re justitiam , quæ nec praesenti sæculo, nec futurae forsitan displi- cere potuisset aetati?",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 509,
    "date_range": [
      493,
      526
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th#PL72.TH.2.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.TH.2.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed quia non nostrum judicavi­ mus de ecclesiasticis aliquid censere negotiis : ideo vos die diversis provinciis fecimus evocare;",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 509,
    "date_range": [
      493,
      526
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th#PL72.TH.2.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.TH.2.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ut sub divini timore judicii, totius certaminis vobis dispo­ nentibus causa transiret, urbique nostrae, Deo fa- vente, optata per vos concordia redderetur.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 509,
    "date_range": [
      493,
      526
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th#PL72.TH.2.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.TH.2.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nec vero eadem quæ dudum praesentibus intimamus ut- culis, nos coram Deo et hominibus absolventes, t causam Dei,",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 509,
    "date_range": [
      493,
      526
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th#PL72.TH.2.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.TH.2.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "quam vestrae congregationis amplissiunt senatui, et pacem clericis sperautes, commissimus, quemadmodum visum vobis fuerit, ordinetis;",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 509,
    "date_range": [
      493,
      526
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th#PL72.TH.2.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.TH.2.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "nec a nobis vestri exspectelurforma judicii, sed vos qualiter vultis ordinate.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 509,
    "date_range": [
      493,
      526
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th#PL72.TH.2.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.TH.2.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sive discussa, sive indiscussa causa, proferre sententiam, de qua estis rationem divina judicio reddituri;",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 509,
    "date_range": [
      493,
      526
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th#PL72.TH.2.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.TH.2.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "dummodo, sicuti saepe diximus, hoc deliberatio vestra provideat, ut pax senatui popu­ loque Romano,",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 509,
    "date_range": [
      493,
      526
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th#PL72.TH.2.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/theodericus-rex/pl72_52_th",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.TH.2.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "submota omni confusione reddatur, ne qua, quod absit, post judicium turba, aut aliqua remaneat in civitate discordia.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 509,
    "date_range": [
